<urn:atm:triage:finding/AW3-CI-007>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AW3-CI-007" ;
  triage:title "Test (windows-latest) fails at 95230ff18: default_jsonl_snapshot golden-bytes test compares against an include_str fixture that the Windows checkout converts to CRLF" ;
  triage:description "PR #1182 at 95230ff18, Test (windows-latest): commands::log::tests::default_jsonl_snapshot_matches_the_pre_aw3_golden_bytes fails assertion left == right at log.rs:1107; the rendered bytes are LF and the include_str fixture crates/atm/tests/fixtures/log-jsonl-default.json comes back with CRLF because the Windows runner checks out with autocrlf and the repo has no .gitattributes. Same class as AW2-CI-004. Fix: add a .gitattributes entry pinning the fixture (or crates/atm/tests/fixtures/**) to eol=lf, or normalize carriage returns from the golden before comparing; keep the byte-exact intent for the LF form. Run cargo test -p agent-team-mail and full just lint before pushing." ;
